sequenceDiagram
    actor W as Warden
    participant UI as Web UI (C1)
    participant AC as Auth & Access (C2)
    participant AL as Allocation (C5)
    participant DA as Data Access (C9)
    participant DB as MySQL (C10)
    participant AU as Audit (C8)
    W->>UI: select student + available bed, confirm
    UI->>AC: verify session & role (Admin/Warden)
    AC-->>UI: authorised
    UI->>AL: allocate(student_id, bed_id)
    AL->>DA: begin transaction
    DA->>DB: SELECT bed FOR UPDATE; load student + active allocation
    DB-->>DA: bed, student, hostel data
    AL->>AL: check student Active, no active allocation, bed Available, gender = hostel type
    alt any rule fails
        AL->>DA: rollback
        AL-->>UI: 409 occupied / 409 already allocated / 422 gender mismatch
        UI-->>W: show reason
    else all rules pass
        AL->>DA: create allocation; set bed = Occupied
        DA->>DB: INSERT allocation; UPDATE bed; COMMIT
        DB-->>DA: committed
        AL->>AU: log(user, ALLOCATE, student, bed, time)
        AL-->>UI: 201 Created (allocation id, date)
        UI-->>W: confirmation shown
    end
